{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe heat in Vienna is immense, but the evening was a delight. I spent two hours at the Belvedere, then settled into the opera house for Rossini’s *Barber of Seville*. Lablache was a magnificent Figaro, and young de Franco, though new, held his own against Ambrogi’s Bartolo. The audience here is quite unlike Berlin; they clapped after nearly every scene, forcing the singers to return again and again. I read the theatre notices with amusement at their enthusiasm.\n\nI must confess, the Partheys accompanied me, as I urged them to do at every performance. They are charming company, though their constant chatter about the soprano’s hair almost made me miss the finale. I am tired, but my spirits are high. I miss your quiet counsel and the sound of the house in Berlin. Give my love to the boys.\n\nYour devoted\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080399,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":194,"prompt_tokens":952,"total_tokens":1146,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-EyiZ2GQuJJXgQVutstNQS4xRJAjwPy9z","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":952,"prompt_ms":925.385,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9720430672268907,"prompt_per_second":1028.7610021774722,"predicted_n":194,"predicted_ms":4615.263,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.913279792746113,"predicted_per_second":41.81776856486835}}